      <add key="FEATURE_SHOWCASE_NL_Body_Keep_Most_Urgent_On_Top" value="Turn on &quot;Manage stack urgency&quot; so Jurojin keeps the most urgent table on top when you stack several tables in one slot. Also turn off your poker site's own table focus/urgency option, so it doesn't fight with Jurojin." />
      <add key="FEATURE_SHOWCASE_NL_Body_Auto_Focus_Most_Urgent" value="Turn on &quot;Auto Focus Most Urgent Table Always&quot; and Jurojin will always keep the most urgent table on top, even when your tables overlap. Also turn off your poker site's own table focus/urgency option, so it doesn't fight with Jurojin." />
      <add key="FEATURE_SHOWCASE_TOAST_Configuration_Suggestion" value="Jurojin's got a Configuration Suggestion for you!" />
    </sub>
